// QNMF Ablation: No-P6 (ECRA Adaptive Compute Controller Disabled)
// Base architecture with P1 State, P2 Memory, P3 Routing, P4 World Model
// Dynamic complexity routing disabled; all queries evaluated at fixed maximum Level 3 compute

network QNMFAblationP6 ⟦
    dense ⟬128⸴ 256⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬256⸴ 2048⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬2048⸴ 256⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬256⸴ 128⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "QNMF_ABLATION_P6_NO_ECRA_INITIALIZED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
